{"title":"Career roadmap — Culinary Entrepreneur","role":"Culinary Entrepreneur","summary":"A Culinary Entrepreneur builds and operates a food business using culinary expertise combined with product development, food safety, costing, operations, branding, marketing, customer experience, and financial management.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc. (Bachelor of Science – General / Honours)","Course":"Culinary Science / Bakery & Confectionery"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible ventures include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Restaurants"},{"text":"Bakeries"},{"text":"Cafés"},{"text":"Cloud kitchens"},{"text":"Catering businesses"},{"text":"Dessert brands"},{"text":"Artisan food brands"},{"text":"Packaged-food businesses"},{"text":"Specialty beverage businesses"},{"text":"Food trucks"},{"text":"Online-first food brands"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Culinary Skill","Food Science","Business","Cost Control","Digital Marketing"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Primary focus","Likely opportunities"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Culinary fundamentals, product development, operations"},{"text":"Culinary Entrepreneur, Bakery Entrepreneur, Food Business Founder"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Brand building, unit economics, team management"},{"text":"Restaurant/Café Owner, Food Brand Founder"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Multi-unit expansion, packaged products, systems"},{"text":"Food Business Director, Multi-Outlet Entrepreneur"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Brand portfolio, franchising, food manufacturing"},{"text":"Food Group Founder, Culinary Brand Investor"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build during the B.Sc.","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Culinary foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong skills in:"},{"type":"lis